  "text": "## Purpose & Scope  \n### Purpose  \nTo establish procedures for personal data protection that:\n- Comply with GDPR and UK Data Protection Act\n- Respect customer privacy rights\n- Secure personal data against unauthorized access\n- Manage customer subject access requests\n- Implement data subject rights (access, erasure, portability)",
